{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践：多维、应用与落地","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multidim-isotonic","title":"多维保序：维度的诅咒与可行路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/multidim-isotonic","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"isotonic-applications","title":"应用：排序、剂量反应与 ROC 凸化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/isotonic-applications","wordCount":1497,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"isotonic-in-practice","title":"落地与边界：scikit-learn 里的保序回归工程手册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/isotonic-in-practice","wordCount":1338,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践-多维-应用与落地\">实践：多维、应用与落地</h1><p>前三章把保序回归从动机、数学、算法讲到它最重要的校准应用。本章走向真实世界：当单调不再是一维、当场景不再是校准、当代码真的要上生产时，会遇到什么。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"multidim-isotonic\">多维保序</a> 面对一个残酷的事实：一维保序有优雅的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 解，但一旦输入是多维、约束变成偏序格上的单调，问题的计算成本急剧上升，解也可能不唯一。本篇讲多维单调回归的形式化、计算困难、以及格点回归、加性近似等可行路径。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"isotonic-applications\">应用</a> 展示校准之外的舞台：信息检索里的排序打分单调化、药理学的剂量-反应曲线估计、ROC 曲线的凸包化、生物统计中的单调剂量趋势检验。这些场景共享同一个数学内核，却各有落地细节。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"isotonic-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 是工程手册：scikit-learn 1.9 的 <code>IsotonicRegression</code> API、<code>out_of_bounds</code> 越界处理、并列值与权重、外推的危险、以及什么时候不该用保序回归。</p>\n<p>本章大量回指前文：多维困难的根源在第一章的 <a href=\"../foundations/monotonic-constraint\">单调约束</a> 与凸锥结构，落地行为的解释在第二章的 <a href=\"../algorithms/complexity\">复杂度</a>。它也把保序回归与相邻工具连起来——剂量趋势与 <a href=\"../../ordinal-regression-methods/practice/ordinal-applications\">序数回归</a>、排序打分与检索质量的监控 <a href=\"../../data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations/why-monitoring\">模型监控</a>。</p>\n"}